    "/v1/chat": {
      "post": {
        "description": "POST /v1/chat：启动一轮 SSE 流式对话。\n\nreq: 请求体 ChatReq —— thread_id 串起多轮与后续人工审核，message 是用户输入。\nx_api_key: 请求头 X-API-Key。配了 TENANT_KEYS 时由它**反查租户**；否则校验 SERVE_API_KEY。\nx_tenant_id: 请求头 X-Tenant-Id，多租户模式下**仅用于核对**（与 Key 不符返回 403）。\n\n内部把 message 包成 HumanMessage 作为图输入；若图停在 human_review，\n流里会下发 need_review 事件（草稿 + 评分 + 意见），由前端调 /review 续跑。\n请求处理前会过\"限流 → 配额 → 会话归属\"三道闸门。",
        "operationId": "chat_v1_v1_chat_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-tenant-id",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Tenant-Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatReq"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Chat V1",
        "tags": [
          "v1"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/v1/chat/resume": {
      "post": {
        "description": "POST /v1/chat/resume：续跑一条**中途断掉**的会话（SSE，事件与 /v1/chat 相同）。\n\nreq: 请求体 ResumeReq，只有 thread_id —— 要跑的内容早就在检查点里了。\nx_api_key / x_tenant_id: 同 /v1/chat。\n\n语义（实测确认，不是推测）：检查点停在**当前未完成的那个节点之前**，\n所以续跑是**重新执行该节点**，而不是\"接上上次的半个 token\"。\n对客户端而言是\"从头把这次回答重新流一遍\"，拿到的是完整、自洽的正文。\n对账时注意：这会**再花一次**该节点的 token（但省掉了前面已完成的检索与迭代）。\n\n三种状态各自该走哪条路：\n    next 含 human_review  → 409，提示调 POST /v1/review（需要人的决定，不是续跑）；\n    next 空               → 409，本轮已收尾，没有可续的内容；\n    其余（next 非空）      → 200 + SSE，用 `astream(None, ...)` 从检查点继续。\n\n⚠️ 为什么不做成\"自动判断后用一条接口搞定一切\"：把\"要人的决定\"和\"机器能自己跑完\"\n混在一个接口里，客户端就无法区分\"我需要弹审核界面\"和\"我可以直接继续\" ——\n而这正是 human-in-the-loop 里唯一必须由人做的分支。宁可让客户端多判断一次。",
        "operationId": "chat_resume_v1_v1_chat_resume_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-tenant-id",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Tenant-Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResumeReq"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Chat Resume V1",
        "tags": [
          "v1"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/v1/review": {
      "post": {
        "description": "POST /v1/review：人工审核 resume，续跑被 interrupt 挂起的图。\n\nreq: 请求体 ReviewReq。thread_id 用于定位会话；action 只允许 accept / revise；\n    feedback 在 revise 时必填（accept 时可留空）。\nx_api_key / x_tenant_id: 同 /v1/chat。\n\n三道前置校验，任一条不过都不进入图：\n  - action 非 accept/revise → 400；\n  - revise 但 feedback 全空白 → 400；\n  - 该 thread 当前并不停在 human_review（如已完成、或从未触发）→ 409。\n通过后把队列里的记录标记为已处理（accepted / revised）。",
        "operationId": "review_v1_v1_review_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-tenant-id",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Tenant-Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReviewReq"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
