    "/v1/sessions/{thread_id}": {
      "delete": {
        "description": "DELETE /v1/sessions/{thread_id}：**履行删除请求**（合规要求，此前无处可做）。\n\n删三类数据，缺一类都算不上\"删干净\"：\n\n  1. **检查点** —— 完整对话历史、所有中间草稿、评分与引用。数据主体；\n  2. **审核队列记录** —— 待审/已审的草稿正文与审核意见。它独立存表，\n     只删检查点会留下一份\"幽灵草稿\"；\n  3. **归属登记行** —— 不删会让同一个 thread_id 永久挂在旧租户名下：\n     归属表只增不减，且该 id 之后谁也再用不了（新租户来会被判 403）。\n\n为什么必须做归属校验（而不是\"有合法 Key 就能删\"）\n----------------------------------------------\n`thread_id` 是**客户端提供的**。只要能猜到别人的 id 就能删掉那条会话 ——\n这比\"读\"严重一个量级：读是泄露，删是**不可逆的破坏**。所以这里复用\n`_assert_session_readable` 的 fail-closed 语义：多租户下归属不符 403、\n查不到属主 404（两种情况分开，是因为处置方式不同：前者是攻击信号，\n后者是\"id 不存在\"）。\n\n为什么单租户下删不存在的会话也返回成功\n------------------------------------\n返回 404 会把端点变成\"这个 thread_id 存在吗\"的探针。删除本身是幂等的，\n`deleted` 明细已经如实告诉调用方每一项到底删掉没有。\n\n为什么不做成\"软删除\"\n------------------\n软删除（打标记）保住的是\"万一删错了还能恢复\"，但对合规诉求毫无帮助 ——\n数据仍在库里。真要可恢复应该靠备份，而不是让线上库长期留着已承诺删除的内容。",
        "operationId": "session_delete_v1_v1_sessions__thread_id__delete",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "thread_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Thread Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-tenant-id",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Tenant-Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Session Delete V1",
        "tags": [
          "v1"
        ]
      },
      "get": {
        "description": "GET /v1/sessions/{thread_id}：取会话的**持久化状态快照**（断点续传的基础）。\n\nthread_id: 会话 id（路径参数）。\nx_api_key / x_tenant_id: 同 /v1/chat。\n\n返回（全部字段都是 JSON 原生类型）：\n    status            unknown | awaiting_review | incomplete | completed\n    resumable         true 时请调 POST /v1/chat/resume 续跑\n    draft             最新草稿全文（断流后\"已经生成到哪了\"就是它）\n    messages          完整对话历史，[{role, content}]，role ∈ user/assistant/system/tool\n    citations         上一轮的引用（来源/页码/节选，供回溯核对）\n    score / feedback  评审分数与意见\n    pending_review    待人工审核时的 {draft, score, feedback, error}，否则 null\n\n为什么是 GET + 纯读：客户端重连后第一件事就是\"我刚才进行到哪了\"，\n这个动作必须幂等、无副作用，才能安全重试。",
        "operationId": "session_state_v1_v1_sessions__thread_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "thread_id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "title": "Thread Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Api-Key",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "x-tenant-id",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": "",
              "title": "X-Tenant-Id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Successful Response"
          },
          "422": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Validation Error"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Session State V1",
        "tags": [
